Please give a list of 2 or more items or a single integer greater then 1
Usage:
  ch-2.p6 <n> -- Make a random list of length N integers between -100 and 100 then give the wave sorted versions
  ch-2.p6 [<input> ...] -- Given a list of integers return all the wave sorted lists
  
    <n>    Positive integer 2 <= N <= 20
